...@../../../dev/d2/themes/flow
direction: down
caller: Weaver / MRR\nTyped build and test requests {class: card}
facade: gerbil-scheme-build\nEmbedded tooling session {class: card}
bridge: Gerbil C ABI\nChecked values / rooted ownership {class: card}
owner: Existing VM owner\nThread affinity / session generation {class: card}
scheme: Scheme build.ss / gxtest\nPackageSpec / existing test semantics {class: card}
image: Admitted tooling image\nCompiler / expander / package closure {class: card}
tokio: Tokio coordination\nReadiness / backpressure / cancellation {class: card}
complete: Build and test receipts\nComplete artifacts / actual completion {class: card}
refused: Refused or unresolved operation\nRetain owner / await cleanup {class: card}
caller -> facade: typed operation
facade -> bridge: direct foreign call
bridge -> owner: owner-checked entry
image -> owner: admitted module closure
owner -> scheme: existing Scheme semantics
tokio -> owner: coordinated admission
scheme -> complete: artifact and test evidence
scheme -> refused: exception or unresolved outcome
complete -> caller: checked result
refused -> tokio: cleanup observation

